  "notes": [
    "-AR verb with a **spelling change: z→c before e** to preserve the soft /s/ sound",
    "This affects only the **pretérito indefinido yo** form: *adelgacé* (not *adelgazé*)",
    "All other forms follow regular -AR patterns",
    "Past participle: *adelgazado* (regular)",
    "Common usage: *adelgazar cinco kilos* (to lose five kilos), *quiero adelgazar* (I want to lose weight)",
    "Related: *delgado/a* (thin/slim), *engordar* (to put on weight — opposite)"
